  "body_html": "<h1>Marginal Contribution</h1>\n<p>The <strong>marginal contribution</strong> of player $i$ to a coalition $S$ not\ncontaining $i$ is\n$$\n  v(S \\cup \\{i\\}) - v(S).\n$$</p>\n<p>This is the payoff increment created by adding $i$ to $S$. Shapley-value\nformulae average this quantity over all possible predecessor coalitions.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MSZ Ch.18, §18.2] Maschler, Solan, Zamir, <em>Game Theory</em>,\n  <code>references/GameTheory.pdf</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
